{
      "name": "BFS — 04 Upload",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "content": "## BFS — 04 Upload\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Receives data through a webhook.\n2. Prepares the received document with custom code.\n3. Sends a POST request to the OpenAI API for embeddings.\n4. Saves the document data to a Supabase database.\n5. Responds successfully back to the origin of the webhook.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure Webhook URL to receive data\n- [ ] Set up HTTP Request credentials for OpenAI API\n- [ ] Configure Supabase credentials to store data\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can customize the HTTP request parameters to change the API endpoint or data sent to OpenAI.",
            "width": 480,
            "height": 576
          },
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
